flowchart TD
    A[Customer chat request] --> B[POST /chat/turn API]
    B --> C[ConversationOrchestrator]

    C --> D[Load tenant config, constraints, and conversation memory]
    D --> E[Intent recognition]
    E --> E1[LLM classifier + local embedding + keyword voting]
    E1 --> F{Low-risk fast path?}

    F -->|Yes| G[General-agent task]
    F -->|No| H{LLM role planner enabled?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Select roles from trusted allowlist]
    H -->|No or fallback| J[Deterministic intent and keyword routing]
    I --> K[Build dependency-aware plan]
    J --> K

    K --> L{Policy/playbook needed?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Playbook retrieval task]
    M --> N[Query rewrite -> parallel recall -> dedupe -> LLM rerank]
    N --> O[pgvector tenant playbooks]
    O --> P[Answer specialist task(s)]
    L -->|No| P

    P --> Q[DelegationManager]
    Q --> R[Parallel ready subagent batches]
    R --> S[ReAct loop]
    S --> S1[Role prompt + matching tenant Skills]
    S1 --> S2{Tool needed?}
    S2 -->|Yes| S3[Read-only MCP tool call]
    S3 --> S
    S2 -->|No| T[Subagent results]

    T --> U{Critic required?}
    U -->|Yes| V[ComplianceCriticAgent]
    U -->|No, simple-plan bypass enabled| W[Local approval]
    V --> X{Approved?}
    X -->|No| Y[Retry plan once with compliance constraint]
    Y --> V
    X -->|Yes| W

    W --> Z[Emit customer response]
    Z --> AA[Store chat messages]
    AA --> AB[Background profile update]
    Z --> AC{Complaint, escalation, or high urgency?}
    AC -->|Yes| AD[Start Temporal ProcessSignalWorkflow]
    AC -->|No| AE[Complete]
    AD --> AE

    C -. telemetry .-> AF[Structured logs + optional Langfuse / OpenTelemetry]
    Q -. role success and latency .-> AG[PerformanceMonitor]
    AG -. routing penalties .-> Q

    classDef async fill:#FFF3CD,stroke:#856404,color:#111;
    classDef safety fill:#F8D7DA,stroke:#842029,color:#111;
    classDef storage fill:#D1E7DD,stroke:#0F5132,color:#111;
    class AB,AD async;
    class V,Y safety;
    class D,O,AA storage;
